        <item>
            <title>0.62</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:42:33 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202610091539</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.62</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A rocket whose release is no longer cleared before it lights stands by again and calls off the carries it ordered aboard</li>
<li>Minions' suits are a light grey, so the lights leave their sunlit faces white and shade the others, not one flat white</li>
<li>Stepping into the walk fades in smoothly: no flat wall outlines at the start, the hull pieces fade out</li>
<li>Walking, signs show the way: what lies down each arm of the plaza, where the main route forks, and the way back to the monolith from among the offices</li>
<li>Minion suits are baked into the app; the repository's patch is worn over them, up close only</li>
<li>The frame counter sits beside the window's buttons, not under them</li>
<li>Up close, a crate shows its task's number, title and whose it is, in one of four cases; the rocket's plating is one size all over</li>
<li>Walking, the hull comes down as glass onto a low steel sill</li>
<li>Double-click the station's floor to walk in right there</li>
<li>Minions read plain white from the station view; their suits show soft detail only up close</li>
<li>Floors, crates and the station's rockets carry fine detail up close, and read as before from the station view</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
